  "scope": "The prior test files under packages/screamingface/tests/ that C1 and C2 change. While this branch is stacked on OME-1895-e5-p2-engine it also carries that branch's approved Engine entries, unchanged, so the stack's pre-push check passes; they drop out when this branch is rebased onto main after #1759 merges.",
